NAME
        general - the 'general' commands

SYNOPSIS
        this is no command, just information

DESCRIPTION
        The following commands are available everywhere

        Activities
        ----------
        drop|get|take|give <item>, look, look at|examine <item>
        
        Information
        -----------
        status, i(inventory), headers

        Communication
        -------------
        '(say), who 

